  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 女性发型库｜偏好方向批次07\n\n## 长款 Hush Cut＋轻狼尾＋碎薄帘刘海\n\n用户明确偏好：保留黑长发与女性感，顶部轻蓬松，脸侧层次明显，发尾轻而长；不要硬水母断层，不要夸张鲻鱼尾，也不要普通无层次长直发。\n\n第01张为高度疑似原图候选，仍等待用户肉眼确认；其余3张用于锁定方向。",
      "x": -1450,
      "y": -850,
      "width": 2900,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "definition",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 结构判定\n\n**主类型：** 长款 Hush Cut\n**次类型：** 轻狼尾／长层Shag\n**刘海：** 碎薄帘刘海＋长脸周须\n\n**必须保留**\n- 长度到胸下或更长\n- 冠部轻体量，不做厚圆壳\n- 眼角、颧骨、下颌至少三级脸周层\n- 发尾细长、轻、连续\n\n**排除**\n- 水母头：上下硬断层过强\n- 经典狼尾：前短后长和后颈尾过强\n- 蝴蝶剪：吹风外翻和90年代大体量过强\n- 普通长直发：脸周层和冠部纹理不足",
      "x": -800,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 850,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-01",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch07_hush_direction/07_01_possible_original.jpg",
      "x": -1450,
      "y": -250,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "card-01",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 01｜高度疑似原图｜顺直长层轻狼尾\n### Sleek Layered Wolf / Hush Hybrid\n\n页面描述为深色纹理层次、分层刘海、黑色服装、紫色渐变背景，与用户给出的参考图高度吻合；未冒充100%原图。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://thebeautyfoodie.com/korean-wolf-cut/)\n\n图源：TheBeautyFoodie，条目 7：Sleek Layered Wolf Cut\n\n**状态：** `possible-original / user-confirmation-pending`",
      "x": -910,
      "y": -250,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-02",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch07_hush_direction/07_02_soft_black_korean_layers.png",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -250,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "card-02",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 02｜柔黑韩式长层\n### Soft Black Korean-Inspired Layers\n\n保留黑长发主体，以柔和脸周层和轻薄轮廓增加流动，不做强烈鲻鱼尾。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://creativebooster.net/blogs/hairstyles/long-layered-haircuts-2026)\n\n图源：CreativeBooster，条目21\n\n**状态：** `direction-reference / source-confirmed`",
      "x": 540,
      "y": -250,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-03",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch07_hush_direction/07_03_long_hush_cut.jpg",
      "x": -1450,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "card-03",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 03｜长款羽毛Hush层次\n### Long Feathered Hush Cut\n\n轻羽毛层、脸周渐进层次、薄刘海和长发主体并存，属于用户偏好方向的温柔端。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.mujerhoy.com/belleza/pelo/corte-hush-cut-tendencia-pelo-otono-2023-20230923114458-nt.html)\n\n图源：Mujerhoy / @jimmywaworuntu\n\n**状态：** `direction-reference / source-confirmed`",
      "x": -910,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref-04",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "05-银矿库/角色库/发型库总表/assets/refs/batch07_hush_direction/07_04_wispy_fringe_hush.jpg",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "card-04",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 04｜韩式碎薄帘刘海Hush\n### Korean Wispy Fringe Hush Cut\n\n重点观察碎薄刘海、颧骨至下颌的脸侧短层，以及发尾轻而不断的长轴。\n\n[打开来源页面](https://www.mujerhoy.com/belleza/pelo/corte-hush-cut-tendencia-pelo-otono-2023-20230923114458-nt.html)\n\n图源：Mujerhoy / @my.o_noji\n\n**状态：** `direction-reference / source-confirmed`",
